{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-12","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：比例与整数","englishTitle":"If any number of magnitudes be proportional, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so will all the antecedents be to all the consequents.","book":5,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.12/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-12@raw-cf0cf5b6352e3850","contentId":"euclid-5-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf0cf5b6352e3850bb58f84aa8f28990b5b1d07a212c70147e7182dbcc4dd0b7","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-12.statement","euclid-5-12.construction.1","euclid-5-12.proof.1","euclid-5-12.proof.2","euclid-5-12.proof.3","euclid-5-12.proof.4","euclid-5-12.conclusion","euclid-5-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-12","revisionId":"euclid-5-12@raw-cf0cf5b6352e3850","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"acf718179b51134ddba196b2a947449a6b4a3b98ceebd8f4adaff846befb1868","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If any number of magnitudes be proportional, as one of the antecedents is to one of the consequents, so will all the antecedents be to all the consequents."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果任何数量是成比例, 因为一个前奏是 其中一个后奏, 所有前奏也是所有后奏。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-12","revisionId":"euclid-5-12@raw-cf0cf5b6352e3850","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4adf2eb00c9be8d48443557880842bb730541998a50310caf2f556fa80159c59","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let any number of magnitudes A, B, C, D, E, F be proportional, so that, as A is to B, so is C to D and E to F; I say that, as A is to B, so are A, C, E to B, D, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何数量,A、B、C、D、E、F等,均等于成比例,A-B等之比等于C-D和E-F;我说,A至B等之比等于A、C、E至B；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-12","revisionId":"euclid-5-12@raw-cf0cf5b6352e3850","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d20c6b956cc8f09212a4cfb34d496e266ed8eabe9589cb90e73a8dffd7383e83","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For of A, C, E let equimultiples G, H, K be taken, and of B, D, F other, chance, equimultiples L, M, N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A中,C、E被劫持,同倍数被劫持,G被劫持,H被劫持,K被劫持,B被劫持,D被劫持,F被劫持,机会为同倍数,L、M和N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-12","revisionId":"euclid-5-12@raw-cf0cf5b6352e3850","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a79443f19c8a58eb10db78fb9adedce8efdcc619766f6a722370b1f5d03123f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since, as A is to B, so is C to D, and E to F, and of A, C, E equimultiples G, H, K have been taken, and of B, D, F other, chance, equimultiples L, M, N, therefore, if G is in excess of L, H is also in excess of M, and K of N, if equal, equal, and if less, less; so that, in addition, if G is in excess of L, then G, H, K are in excess of L, M, N, if equal, equal, and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"此后,A-B的比等于C-D和E-F的比,A、C、E、A、G、H、K的比,B、D、F、F、同倍数、L、M、N的比,因此,如果G超过L、H的比,则超过M,N的比,如果相等,则少于K;从而,如果G项超过L项,那么G项,H项,K项超过L、M、N项,如果相等,则相等,如果较少,则更少；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-12.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-12","revisionId":"euclid-5-12@raw-cf0cf5b6352e3850","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1aa2c0d54441fd16861455f0bc8f6b6ad563f1fff0262cb462c496e2eafff1d7","citations":["euclid-5-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now G and G, H, K are equimultiples of A and A, C, E, since, if any number of magnitudes whatever are respectively equimultiples of any magnitudes equal in multitude, whatever multiple one of the magnitudes is of one, that multiple also will all be of all. [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在G和G,H,K是A和C中的同倍数,C,E,因为,如果任何数量,无论数量大小,无论数量大小,无论数量大小,无论数量大小,无论数量大小,无论数量大小,均是多个,那么,数量数量也都是全部。 [[V. 1](/principles/euclid-5-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-12.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-12","revisionId":"euclid-5-12@raw-cf0cf5b6352e3850","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ce8bf0f512617906dbeb68e823613b13f1a21f08a0ad213c1703e76e618cc01c","citations":["euclid-5-def-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason L and L, M, N are also equimultiples of B and B, D, F; therefore, as A is to B, so are A, C, E to B, D, F. [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同理，L 与 L、M、N 分别也是 B 与 B、D、F 的同倍数；因此 A 与 B 之比，等于 A、C、E 的总和与 B、D、F 的总和之比。 [[V. Def. 5](/principles/euclid-5-def-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-12.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-12","revisionId":"euclid-5-12@raw-cf0cf5b6352e3850","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-12.source","contentId":"euclid-5-12","revisionId":"euclid-5-12@raw-cf0cf5b6352e3850","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fc0c4e788154fe0a120acebbc51ace002c86134816963a5b2aa43c168a79d49b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.12/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.12\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-12:euclid-5-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-12.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"V. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-12:euclid-5-def-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-12.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-def-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg